// ── one page of rows ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

// `s` with the limit and offset a page of `size` at `page` needs,
// counting pages from zero.
//
// Published because the arithmetic is two lines and is written wrongly
// in two ways — an off-by-one on the page number, and an offset that
// grows without the limit — often enough that it belongs in the
// package that renders it.
//
// ```novo
// use qbbuild
//
// fn main() [io]
//     println("${qbbuild.page(qbbuild.select(), 2, 25).offset}")
// ```
